    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_single_arm.header": "Adding suspension on physified cogwheels - SRDS System",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_single_arm.text_1": "Suspension in this mod does not come for granted like other mods do.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_single_arm.text_2": "In order to allow for different designs, you can §eselect§r whether you want your tracks to have suspension.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_single_arm.text_3": "§7By §7not §7having §7suspension, §7the §7whole §7vehicle §7moves §7as §7one §7entire §7body",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_single_arm.text_4": "So let's give Bob a smoother ride to go over the bumps with.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_single_arm.text_5": "The first type of suspension is a §e§nSingle-arm §e§nRotary §e§nDamper §e§nSuspension",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_single_arm.text_6": "It moves in an §earc§r, its pivot should be placed §ntowards §nthe §nfront §nof §nyour §nvehicle",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_single_arm.text_7": "§7Remember §7that §7in §7order §7to §7use §7the §7suspension, §7your §7cogwheel §7needs §7to §7have §7it's §7physics §7§nactivated.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_single_arm.text_8": "§7As §7you §7can §7see, §7with §7the §7suspension §7the §7ride §7is §7much §7more §7pleasant §7for §7Bob",

    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_bogie.header": "Adding suspension on physified cogwheels - VDSS system",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_bogie.text_1": "If the SRDS is not quite your type of movement, there are other kinds of suspension systems you can use in Bits 'n' Tracks.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_bogie.text_2": "To remove a suspension piece, you can do so by shift-right-clicking with an empty hand on the cogwheel it is placed on.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_bogie.text_3": "The second suspension system involves mounting 2 cogwheels together to form a §ebogie§r.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_bogie.text_4": "This is the §e§nVertical §e§nDual §e§nSpring §e§nSuspension",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_bogie.text_5": "Differently than the SRDS, the VDSS is stiffer, and offers a similar motion to a §elinear§r than a §erotary§r system, with less pushback and shorter travel.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_piece_bogie.text_6": "You might want to consider this over the SRDS when building heavy tracked vehicles with suspension, as the bogie'd setup allows for the load to be split evenly across 2 cogwheels instead of individually",

    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_tool_configuring.header": "Configuring suspension with the Suspension Tool",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_tool_configuring.text_1": "Any mod that has suspension of course has to add a way to tune it based on your needs, and this is what the Suspension Tool is useful for",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_tool_configuring.text_2": "The Suspension Tool has §e4 §edifferent §emodes§r and §6different §6groupings§r.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_tool_configuring.text_3": "Visual aid on the tool's gauge will tell you the magnitude shift for each setting.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_tool_configuring.text_4": "By right-clicking you increase, shift-right-click to decrease the value.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_tool_configuring.text_5": "Changing the values of a VDSS, changes the individual values of BOTH cogwheels.",
    "bits_n_tracks.ponder.suspension_tool_configuring.text_6": "Suspension values are saved on the cogwheel, even after a suspension piece has been removed"
}
